  "notes": [
    "**Preocupar** is a regular **-AR verb**",
    "No spelling changes or stem changes",
    "Past participle: **preocupado** (regular)",
    "Often used reflexively: **preocuparse (por)** = to worry (about)",
    "Can work like **gustar** with indirect object pronouns: *Me preocupa* (It worries me)",
    "Common usage:",
    "*Me preocupo por ti* (I worry about you)",
    "*Eso me preocupa* (That worries me)",
    "*No te preocupes* (Don't worry)",
    "Related noun: **la preocupación** (worry, concern)",
    "Related adjective: **preocupado/a** (worried)"
  ],
